.SH FILES
.TP
.I build/esp
The repo's staged ESP tree, used as the default source for
.B write esp
and
.BR "xfer esp" ,
and as the default location of the boot log.
.TP
.I \eEFI\eleon\ebootinfo.json
Geometry + resolved config record written by the bootloader at boot time;
consumed by
.BR "lbt info"
(as an explicit dump path) and mirrored by
.BR "lbt json info" .
.TP
.I \eEFI\eleon\eentries.jsonc
Boot entries discovered and written by the bootloader at every boot; the
source of entries for
.BR "lbt discover" .
.TP
.I \evar\elogs\eleon\elog.md
The unified boot log (Markdown, capped at 64 KiB) written by the bootloader;
read by
.BR "lbt log" .
.PP
The boot configuration itself (
.IR ~/.config/leon/boot.toml ,
.IR \eEFI\eleon\eboot.toml )
is managed and consumed by
.BR lbc (1),
not by
.BR lbt .
